 "note": "Every revision id any deployed build has stamped, keyed by (id, slug) -- bare ids are ambiguous here: the founder (dogfood) image shipped 0203-0209 as re-numbered copies of trunk 0210-0216, so trunk 0206 is source_sync_claims while the founder build's 0206 was dogfood_lineage_reconcile. A database stamped 0206 cannot say which 0206 it ran, so no new migration may book an id listed below: 'alembic upgrade head' would treat it as applied and skip its schema on every stamped DB. 'stamp_only' holds ids a build stamped that this tree never shipped a file for; one may gain a file only after being registered in 'absorbed' as a no-op node whose content trunk already ships. check_heads.py and test_migration_chain.py enforce this. 2026-10-03: founder (dogfood) absorbcia zrusena - founder DB na tomto stroji neexistuje, takze stamp_only/absorbed su prazdne a 0208/0209 patria origin reward-model retazcu; nase lokalne migracie boli posunute nad origin 0213_rm_learning_source. MAINTENANCE: ked migracia dosiahne deploynuty build, pridaj jej (id, slug)",
